  "source_review_areas": [
    {
      "area": "finite construction and sparse component",
      "verdict": "source coherent, unexecuted",
      "details": "Reviewed5f47/c26d ctor unchanged; one pre-tree ComponentHost binding retains actual inherited _ready six-floor/gate/art scaffold. Canonical current27/29 gates match; host remains originala7d9 and helper absent intentionally until Root assembles both exact reviewed inputs. Real B05 parent/presented actor, native Scheduler and Bait are used. TEST callback acknowledgement is explicitly not protected campaign checkpoint provenance."
    },
    {
      "area": "fixed setup and neutral resource use",
      "verdict": "source coherent, unexecuted",
      "details": "Witness0b5e independently decodes to the stated neutral HP100 frame and three actual dash receipts FORWARD/BACK/(.5,0,-sqrt(.75)); first two collision-shortened and final X/Z exactly1.350000023841858,-27.939250946044922. Fixture repeats those directions through public request_dash, waits for actual receipt/stability/cooldown, and asserts fixed landing instead of assigning transforms. Initial shells0 only is disclosed; natural reload continues. No blast can pass, so no ammo-consuming attack is used. No direct HP/stage/clock/proof/geometry assignment found."
    },
    {
      "area": "native offers and ordinary first-pool/phase progression",
      "verdict": "source coherent, unexecuted",
      "details": "_drive checks an actually legal ordinary primary before selecting/advancing proof waits, including Foot/Ray full-cadence overlap in paired phase. No forced proof index/direction/lock-only delay, no repeated-cycle search. First real slash spends30->15 native cap, real intro/drained receipts earn eligibility, one public TEST acknowledgement permits first paired cycle, and real second slash must produce0/cleared."
    },
    {
      "area": "actual safety and full cadence",
      "verdict": "source coherent with bounded measurement scope, unexecuted",
      "details": "_step retains actual positions, measured capsule dimensions, contacts, on-floor report, planar floor footprint, live armed exchanges and inherited current/settled-follow framing observations; actual path intervals are checked against current/previous active unions independently of HP/immunity. Final complete paired trace includes holds through full primary cooldown and must clear both actual geometries. Planar floor-footprint checks are not alone a theorem of vertical floor contact or universal fairness; actual on_floor is separately recorded."
    },
    {
      "area": "matched native counterfactual and discriminator",
      "verdict": "source coherent, unexecuted",
      "details": "Both arms need actual success before comparison. Matched first-Foot pose/control/capsule/stats/HP, bait initial floor, ray sample/geometry and member timing relative to first-Foot are required. Only copied old trace timestamps are translated; no gameplay geometry/input/state is changed. Distinct result requires old measured trace conflict with moved Foot, no ray conflict, and different executed dash/ordinary-primary spatial response. Unmatched/equivalent remains exit2 and cannot earn policy credit."
    },
    {
